logic: Security flaw - `indexOf` allows subdomain attacks. Use exact origin matching: `e.origin !== discourseUrl.replace(/\/$/, '')`

```suggestion
    var expectedOrigin = discourseUrl.replace(/\/$/, '').replace(/^(https?:\/\/[^/]+).*/, '$1');
    if (e.origin !== expectedOrigin) { return; }
```
